# Claws Desktop App — Detailed Implementation Plan

> **Source Docs:** [SPECS-DESKTOP-APP.md](file:///Users/fabiofurlano/Downloads/clawdbot-main/claws-build-plan/docs/SPECS-DESKTOP-APP.md) · [IMPLEMENTATION-GUIDE.md](file:///Users/fabiofurlano/Downloads/clawdbot-main/claws-build-plan/docs/IMPLEMENTATION-GUIDE.md) · [CLAUDE.md](file:///Users/fabiofurlano/Downloads/AI-personal-agent/CLAUDE.md)
>
> **Project Location:** `/Users/fabiofurlano/Downloads/AI-personal-agent/claws-desktop/`
> **Tech Stack:** Electron + React + TypeScript + Zustand + SQLite + TailwindCSS

---

## Phase 1 — MVP (Week 1)

> **Goal:** A running Electron app with two switchable modes and one AI provider

---

### Task 1.1 · Initialize Project

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `claws-desktop/` directory, run `npm init -y`, install core deps |
| **Deliverables** | `package.json`, `tsconfig.json`, `tsconfig.electron.json`, `.gitignore`, initial `README.md` |
| **Deps** | `electron`, `react`, `react-dom`, `typescript`, `zustand`, `vite`, `@vitejs/plugin-react`, `concurrently`, `wait-on`, `electron-builder` |
| **Commit** | `chore: Initialize Electron + React + TypeScript project` |
| **Time** | ~15 min |

---

### Task 1.2 · Create Directory Structure

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create all folders from the spec: `electron/ipc/`, `src/components/{ChatMode,AgentMode,common}/`, `src/{stores,hooks,utils}`, `resources/icons` |
| **Commit** | `chore: Set up project directory structure` |
| **Time** | ~5 min |

---

### Task 1.3 · Electron Main Process

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `electron/main.ts` — BrowserWindow (1200×800), dev/prod URL loading, IPC handler for `get-app-path` |
| **Deliverables** | `electron/main.ts` |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add Electron main process` |
| **Time** | ~15 min |

---

### Task 1.4 · Electron Preload Bridge

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `electron/preload.ts` — expose `getAppPath`, `send`, `receive` via `contextBridge` |
| **Deliverables** | `electron/preload.ts` |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add Electron preload bridge` |
| **Time** | ~10 min |

---

### Task 1.5 · Vite + Build Config

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `vite.config.ts`, `index.html`, `electron-builder.yml` and npm scripts (`dev`, `build`, `dist:mac`, `dist:win`) |
| **Deliverables** | `vite.config.ts`, `index.html`, `electron-builder.yml` |
| **Commit** | `chore: Add Vite and Electron Builder configuration` |
| **Time** | ~15 min |

---

### Task 1.6 · React Entry Point

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/main.tsx` (ReactDOM render) and `src/App.tsx` (shell with header + ModeSwitcher + conditional mode rendering) |
| **Deliverables** | `src/main.tsx`, `src/App.tsx` |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add React entry point and App component` |
| **Time** | ~10 min |

---

### Task 1.7 · Zustand Store — `useMode`

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/stores/useMode.ts` — mode state (`chat` \| `agent`), `setMode()`, `toggleMode()`, persisted to localStorage |
| **Key Detail** | Default mode is `chat`. Keyboard shortcut `Cmd/Ctrl+M` added later in Task 1.11 |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add useMode Zustand store` |
| **Time** | ~10 min |

---

### Task 1.8 · Zustand Store — `useChat`

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/stores/useChat.ts` — messages array, `addMessage()` (keeps last 10), `clearMessages()`. **No persistence** (chat mode is private) |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add useChat Zustand store` |
| **Time** | ~10 min |

---

### Task 1.9 · Zustand Store — `useAgent`

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/stores/useAgent.ts` — messages array, memory object (`userProfile`, `patterns`, `preferences`), `addMessage()`, `updateMemory()`, `learnPattern()`. **Persisted** via Zustand middleware |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add useAgent Zustand store` |
| **Time** | ~10 min |

