| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/components/common/ModeSwitcher.tsx` — button toggles between 🤖 Agent / 💬 Chat labels |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add ModeSwitcher component` |
| **Time** | ~10 min |

