### Task 1.11 · ChatMode Component

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/components/ChatMode/ChatMode.tsx` — message list (scrollable), text input, send button, clear button. Clean, minimal, light theme |
| **Key Detail** | Messages limited to last 10. No sidebar, no toolbars |
