### Task 1.12 · AgentMode Component

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/components/AgentMode/AgentMode.tsx` — message list, input, send button, status bar (Ready \| Memory \| Learning), sidebar with memory info |
| **Key Detail** | Dark theme. Shows pattern count and preference count from `useAgent` store |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add AgentMode component` |
