### Task 1.13 · Base Styling

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/styles.css` — global reset, `.app.chat` (light) vs `.app.agent` (dark), header, messages, input area, sidebar, status bar, mode switcher button styles. Colors per spec: chat blue `#4A90E2`, agent green `#2ECC71` |
| **Commit** | `style: Add base styling for Chat and Agent modes` |
| **Time** | ~25 min |

---

### Task 1.14 · Keyboard Shortcut for Mode Switch

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Add global `keydown` listener for `Cmd/Ctrl+M` to toggle mode. Add via `useEffect` in `App.tsx` |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add Cmd/Ctrl+M keyboard shortcut for mode switching` |
| **Time** | ~10 min |

---

### Task 1.15 · OpenAI Provider Integration

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/utils/aiProvider.ts` — function `sendToAI(messages, mode)` that calls OpenAI API. Create `src/stores/useProviders.ts` — stores API key + selected model. Wire into both ChatMode and AgentMode `handleSend()` |
| **Key Details** | Chat mode: `temperature: 0.7`, `max_tokens: ~1000`. Agent mode: `temperature: 0.3`, `max_tokens: ~4000`. API key stored locally (encrypted later) |
| **Commit** | `feat: Integrate OpenAI as first AI provider` |
| **Time** | ~30 min |

---

### Task 1.16 · First Full Test Run

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Run `npm run dev`, verify: app opens, mode switching works, both modes render, messages send & display, keyboard shortcut works |
| **Commit** | `chore: Verify MVP builds and runs correctly` |
| **Time** | ~15 min |

