## Phase 2 — Core Features (Weeks 2–3)

> **Goal:** Memory persistence, skills system, multi-provider support, onboarding

---

### Task 2.1 · SQLite Database Setup

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Install `better-sqlite3`. Create `src/utils/database.ts` — `initDatabase()` creates tables: `conversations`, `memory`, `patterns`, `skills`, `providers` (schema from SPECS) |
| **Key Detail** | DB file at `~/Library/Application Support/Claws/claws_memory.db` (Mac) or `%APPDATA%/Claws/` (Windows) |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add SQLite database initialization` |
| **Time** | ~25 min |

---

### Task 2.2 · Memory System (Agent Mode)

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/utils/memoryManager.ts` — CRUD functions for memory table: `saveMemory()`, `getMemory()`, `deleteMemory()`, `exportMemory()`. Integrate with `useAgent` store — persist memory to SQLite instead of just localStorage |
| **Commit** | `feat: Implement persistent memory system` |
| **Time** | ~30 min |

---

### Task 2.3 · Session Persistence

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/utils/sessionManager.ts` — save/load full agent sessions to `sessions` table. Auto-save on each message. Load last session on startup |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add session persistence for Agent mode` |
| **Time** | ~20 min |

---

### Task 2.4 · Provider Settings UI

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/components/common/ProviderSettings.tsx` — list of providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.), API key input fields (password type), model selector dropdown, "Test Connection" button, active provider radio |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add provider settings UI` |
| **Time** | ~30 min |

---

### Task 2.5 · Multi-Provider Support

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Extend `aiProvider.ts` to support Anthropic. Create provider adapter pattern: `OpenAIAdapter`, `AnthropicAdapter`. Store provider configs in SQLite `providers` table (encrypted API keys) |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add multi-provider support (Anthropic)` |
| **Time** | ~30 min |

---

### Task 2.6 · Settings Page

| | |
|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/components/common/Settings.tsx` — tabbed UI with sections: Providers, Appearance, Data (export/import/clear memory), About. Add gear icon in header to open settings |
| **Commit** | `feat: Add Settings page with tabs` |
| **Time** | ~30 min |

---

