|---|---|
| **What** | Create `src/utils/skillsManager.ts` — `loadSkills()` reads from `skills/` directory, `executeSkill()` dispatches to handler. Create skill interface: `id`, `name`, `description`, `triggers[]`, `handler`, `isActive` |
| **Key Detail** | Skills stored at `~/Library/Application Support/Claws/skills/` |
